!!! oculus/appearance/style.mat
!!! Style rules — how windows are painted.
!!!
!!! Controls the visual rendering parameters: shadows,
!!! corner radii, and elevation levels for the neumorphic
!!! appearance.

book oculus.appearance.style

read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! Elevation levels for window depth.

public elevation begin choice
    when Flat
    when Low
    when Medium
    when High
end choice

!!! Style configuration for rendering windows.

public style-rules begin record
    field corner-radius as override long
    field elevation as elevation
    field has-shadow as boolean
    field border-width as override long
end record
